			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The graveyard of the Monastery lies among broken tombs and crypts. The Crusade does not rest its dead in peace here. Its interrogators have made the crypts a place of torment, where {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link} prisoners suffer until they tell what they know, or until nothing is left of them. The dead of the yard are restless too. Anguished spirits and phantoms drift between the mausoleums, and an undead bloodmage calls out for souls in the deepest crypt. Some of the dead are ancient. Some, like the fallen champion who walks there, once wore the Crusade's own colors.]=],
