			text = [=[The armory is where the Crusade forges its soldiers. Its training grounds ring with drills. Myrmidons, defenders and centurions guard its halls, and the arms of the Crusade are stored in its vaults. {link:herod}Herod{/link}, the Scarlet Champion, rules here, and the arms of the Crusade are his to give. He is the finest warrior of the Monastery, and a crowd of young trainees watches him and waits to be called. It is here that the Crusade turns grieving farmers and orphans into zealots in red.]=],
