			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Cathedral is the sanctuary of the Monastery and the seat of its masters. Its gardens and courtyard are thick with monks, chaplains, abbots and champions of the Crusade. Beyond them, in the great chapel, {link:scarlet-commander-mograine}Scarlet Commander Mograine{/link} waits before the altar, and {link:high-inquisitor-whitemane}High Inquisitor Whitemane{/link} waits behind it. Those who reach the chapel seldom leave it. Further still, in a chamber few ever see, dwells a second High Inquisitor, {link:high-inquisitor-fairbanks}Fairbanks{/link}. Whoever holds the Cathedral holds the Monastery.]=],
